   204	def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
   205	    """Trace each border maroon light ray through pink reflecting squares and grey absorbers, then mark its terminal cell.
   206	
   207	    Input structure:
   208	    - The background is black.
   209	    - The only non-background objects are solid odd-sized squares: pink squares are mirrors and grey squares are absorbers.
   210	    - One or more maroon source pixels lie on the grid border, never in a corner.
